{
  "_about": [
    "The Realm Pass (Shared/pass/PassData.cs reads this; tools/wiki_pass.py builds the wiki's Realm Pass page from it).",
    "Seasons: 'from' and 'until' are UTC days (yyyy-MM-dd), both included, and mustn't overlap. After the last dated season the 'rotation' runs a calendar month each, round and round ('Frostfall II'...).",
    "'free' and 'gilded': each of the 'tiers' tiers' rewards on that track ([] for none). A season's claims are kept by its id, so give a new season a new id. Filling a free tier that was empty while its season runs: list it in the season's 'filled' (an empty tier is marked claimed with its Gilded reward; those marks are cleared once).",
    "Rewards: {\"fame\": n} and {\"gold\": n} to the account, {\"item\": \"<id>\", \"count\": n} to the vault's gift chest, {\"skin\": \"<id>\"} a skin (tools/draw_pass_skins.py draws them; one the account has already pays 'repeatFame'), {\"aura\": id}, {\"color\": id}, {\"petFx\": id} (from 'auras', 'colors' and 'petEffects'), {\"slot\": n} character slots.",
    "An aura, name colour or pet effect the account owns already pays 'repeatFame' fame instead. Never renumber one: accounts own them by id (and the Rust client draws auras and pet effects by it: auras.rs, petfx.rs).",
    "'xp': pass XP for each thing (before Momentum). 'pace': every tier by this share of the season; behind it, XP comes 'momentum' percent faster. Past the last tier, every 'bonusXp' is a Wayfarer's Cache: a roll of 'cache' by weight.",
    "The Gilded track costs 'price' gold for the season, and is retroactive.",
    "'community': while the pass is Gilded, the community goals' loot is rolled 'luck' Overdrive levels luckier, and every stage claimed that rolls loot rolls 'rolls' more times. A Gilded holder can also rally one goal a run: until it ends everyone's contributions to it count 'rallyMultiplier' times, and they share its top prize whatever their place."
  ],
